# Android/Capacitor — local.properties has a machine-specific SDK path,
# never portable across machines/CI; build/ and .gradle/ are pure output.
# Keystores added preemptively, before Phase B ever creates one — a signing
# key committed to git even briefly is effectively permanently compromised.
android/local.properties
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/.gradle/
android/captures/
*.keystore
*.jks

# graphify output — a generated knowledge-graph snapshot, not source. Goes
# stale the moment the codebase changes and is large (MBs of JSON/HTML), so
# treated like /dist rather than committed. Regenerate locally with
# /graphify (requires graphify itself, a separate global install — see
# ~/.claude/skills/graphify — not something this repo can provide).
graphify-out/
src/graphify-out/
